      "start": 16.22,
      "end": 19.92,
      "en": "We have an elementary lesson about making an appointment.",
      "zh": "我们有一个关于预约的基本课程。"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 20.12,
      "end": 21.68,
      "en": "Alright, making an appointment.",
      "zh": "好吧，预约。"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 22.04,
      "end": 22.8,
      "en": "Yeah, that's really helpful.",
      "zh": "是的，这真的很有帮助。"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 23.02,
      "end": 26.1,
      "en": "I guess you have to make appointments for the doctor or...",
      "zh": "我想你必须预约医生或..."
