      "start": 28.56,
      "end": 29.56,
      "en": "Or with your friends, yeah.",
      "zh": "或者和你的朋友一起，是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 29.8,
      "end": 33.06,
      "en": "So, this is language that you can use every day to make appointments.",
