    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 33.68,
      "end": 33.82,
      "en": "Great.",
      "zh": "太好了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 34.1,
      "end": 38.18,
      "en": "Well, so, why don't we take a look at our vocabulary preview.",
