      "en": "We only have one word today which you need to know to understand this dialogue.",
      "zh": "我们今天只有一个词，您需要知道才能理解这种对话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 46.74,
      "end": 49.64,
      "en": "And it is financial advisor.",
      "zh": "它是财务顾问。"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 51.0,
      "end": 52.92,
      "en": "Financial advisor.",
      "zh": "理财顾问。"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 52.92,
      "end": 54.48,
      "en": "Financial advisor.",
      "zh": "理财顾问。"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 54.48,
      "end": 56.62,
      "en": "So, what is a financial advisor?",
      "zh": "那么，什么是财务顾问？"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 57.12,
      "end": 65.82,
      "en": "A financial advisor is a person who gives suggestions or recommendations about investing money.",
      "zh": "财务顾问是提供有关投资资金的建议或建议的人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 66.06,
      "end": 69.68,
      "en": "Someone who wants you to put money in the stock market.",
      "zh": "一个希望你把钱投入股市的人。"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 69.88,
      "end": 70.86,
      "en": "Okay, great.",
      "zh": "好，太好了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 71.26,
      "end": 73.92,
      "en": "I guess we're ready now to listen to our dialogue for the first time.",
      "zh": "我想我们现在已经准备好第一次听我们的对话了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 74.36,
      "end": 79.32,
      "en": "And as always, it's going to be at a normal speed, but you don't have to worry about it because...",
      "zh": "和往常一样，它会以正常速度，但你不必担心它，因为..."
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 79.32,
      "end": 81.8,
      "en": "We'll come back and teach you all the important words.",
      "zh": "我们会回来教你所有重要的词。"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 90.68,
      "end": 91.12,
      "en": "Hello?",
      "zh": "喂？"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 91.88,
      "end": 92.36,
      "en": "Fairbrook Consulting.",
      "zh": "费尔布鲁克咨询。"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 93.0,
      "end": 93.62,
      "en": "How may I help you?",
      "zh": "有什么可以帮您？"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 94.3,
      "end": 95.6,
      "en": "Yes, this is Julianne Horton.",
      "zh": "是的，这是朱丽安·霍顿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 96.12,
      "end": 98.5,
      "en": "And I'm calling to arrange an appointment with Ms. McNeely.",
      "zh": "我打电话是想约见麦克尼利女士。"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 99.34,
      "end": 99.58,
      "en": "Certainly.",
      "zh": "当然可以。"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 99.92,
      "end": 100.94,
      "en": "What day were you thinking of?",
      "zh": "您想约哪天？"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 101.42,
      "end": 102.14,
      "en": "How's Thursday?",
      "zh": "星期四怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 102.54,
      "end": 103.9,
      "en": "Does she have any time available then?",
      "zh": "她那天有空吗？"
    },
