    {
      "id": 50,
      "start": 124.31,
      "end": 124.83,
      "en": "Sorry about that.",
      "zh": "抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "start": 129.99,
      "end": 136.15,
      "en": "Well, I guess Ms. McNeely does not want to speak to any financial advisors.",
      "zh": "好吧，我猜麦克尼利女士不想与任何财务顾问交谈。"
    },
    {
      "id": 52,
      "start": 136.73,
