      "end": 283.24,
      "en": "I'm booked solid over the Christmas holidays.",
      "zh": "我在圣诞节假期订满了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 115,
      "start": 283.24,
      "end": 287.24,
      "en": "Example three.",
      "zh": "例句三。"
    },
    {
      "id": 116,
      "start": 287.59,
      "end": 289.63,
      "en": "Sorry, I can't meet with you today.",
      "zh": "对不起，我今天不能和你见面。"
    },
    {
      "id": 117,
      "start": 290.09,
      "end": 291.03,
      "en": "I'm booked solid.",
      "zh": "我订的很稳。"
    },
    {
      "id": 118,
      "start": 294.7,
      "end": 295.24,
      "en": "Okay, great.",
      "zh": "好，太好了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 119,
      "start": 295.62,
      "end": 296.9,
      "en": "So, booked solid basically is?",
      "zh": "那么，预订实质上是？"
    },
    {
      "id": 120,
      "start": 297.24,
      "end": 300.24,
      "en": "You have no free time, no available time.",
      "zh": "你没有空闲时间，没有空闲时间。"
    },
    {
      "id": 121,
      "start": 300.98,
      "end": 301.24,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 122,
      "start": 301.86,
      "end": 304.24,
      "en": "So, you've got appointments scheduled all day.",
      "zh": "所以，你已经安排了一整天的约会。"
    },
    {
      "id": 123,
      "start": 304.92,
      "end": 305.24,
      "en": "All day, great.",
      "zh": "一整天，太好了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 124,
      "start": 305.24,
      "end": 306.24,
      "en": "Mm-hmm.",
      "zh": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": 125,
      "start": 306.24,
      "end": 310.24,
      "en": "So, with this in mind, now we can listen to our dialogue a second time.",
      "zh": "所以，考虑到这一点，现在我们可以第二次听我们的对话了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 126,
      "start": 310.34,
      "end": 313.78,
      "en": "This time, it's going to be slow, so we can understand a little bit better.",
      "zh": "这一次，它会很慢，所以我们可以更好地理解一点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 127,
      "start": 319.24,
      "end": 322.24,
      "en": "Hello, Fairbrook Consulting.",
      "zh": "您好，费尔布鲁克咨询。"
    },
    {
      "id": 128,
      "start": 322.35,
      "end": 323.23,
      "en": "How may I help you?",
      "zh": "有什么可以帮您？"
    },
    {
      "id": 129,
      "start": 323.72,
      "end": 330.6,
      "en": "Yes, this is Julianne Horton, and I'm calling to arrange an appointment with Ms. McNeely.",
      "zh": "是的，这是 Julianne Horton，我打电话给 McNeely 女士安排约会。"
    },
    {
      "id": 130,
      "start": 331.08,
      "end": 331.74,
      "en": "Certainly.",
      "zh": "当然可以。"
    },
    {
      "id": 131,
      "start": 332.48,
      "end": 334.14,
      "en": "What date were you thinking of?",
      "zh": "你想到的是什么日期？"
    },
    {
      "id": 132,
      "start": 334.5,
      "end": 335.46,
      "en": "How's Thursday?",
      "zh": "星期四怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "id": 133,
      "start": 336.52,
      "end": 339.16,
      "en": "Does she have any time available then?",
      "zh": "她那天有空吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 134,
      "start": 340.24,
      "end": 342.1,
      "en": "Um, let me double check.",
      "zh": "嗯，让我仔细检查一下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 135,
      "start": 343.24,
      "end": 346.4,
      "en": "No, unfortunately, she's booked solid on Thursday.",
      "zh": "不，不幸的是，她周四预订得很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 136,
      "start": 347.28,
      "end": 349.12,
      "en": "How does next Monday work for you?",
      "zh": "下周一您方便吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 137,
      "start": 349.88,
      "end": 353.24,
      "en": "Actually, I've got something scheduled on Monday.",
      "zh": "其实我周一另有安排。"
    },
    {
      "id": 138,
      "start": 353.92,
      "end": 355.32,
      "en": "Can she do Tuesday?",
      "zh": "她可以在星期二做吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 139,
      "start": 356.2,
      "end": 358.24,
      "en": "Sure, Tuesday's perfect.",
      "zh": "当然，周二正好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 140,
      "start": 359.4,
      "end": 361.02,
      "en": "May I ask where you're calling from?",
      "zh": "请问您是哪家公司的？"
    },
    {
      "id": 141,
      "start": 361.9,
      "end": 364.5,
      "en": "Sure, Merton Financial Advisors.",
      "zh": "当然，默顿理财顾问公司。"
    },
    {
      "id": 142,
      "start": 365.24,
      "end": 365.46,
      "en": "Oh.",
      "zh": "哦。"
    },
    {
      "id": 143,
      "start": 366.88,
      "end": 369.34,
      "en": "Actually, Tuesday's no good.",
      "zh": "其实周二不行。"
    },
    {
      "id": 144,
      "start": 370.0,
      "end": 370.6,
      "en": "Sorry about that.",
      "zh": "抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "id": 145,
      "start": 373.91,
      "end": 379.09,
      "en": "Okay, so now it's a little bit more clear, and with this, we can start with putting it together.",
      "zh": "好的，现在它更清楚一点，有了这个，我们可以开始把它放在一起。"
    },
    {
      "id": 146,
      "start": 381.69,
      "end": 382.47,
      "en": "Putting it together.",
      "zh": "综合运用。"
    },
    {
      "id": 147,
      "start": 384.24,
      "end": 392.86,
      "en": "There's some great examples in this dialogue of phrases you can use when you need to schedule an appointment, and we're going to look at those today.",
      "zh": "在您需要安排约会时可以使用的短语对话中有一些很好的示例，我们今天将查看这些短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 148,
      "start": 393.56,
      "end": 399.6,
      "en": "In the dialogue, we heard Julianne ask about making an appointment, and she said this.",
      "zh": "在对话中，我们听到 Julianne 询问预约，她这么说。"
    },
    {
      "id": 149,
      "start": 400.24,
      "end": 404.24,
      "en": "I'm calling to arrange an appointment with Ms. McNeely.",
      "zh": "我打电话给麦克尼利女士安排约会。"
    },
    {
      "id": 150,
      "start": 405.84,
      "end": 410.08,
      "en": "I'm calling to arrange an appointment with Ms. McNeely.",
      "zh": "我打电话给麦克尼利女士安排约会。"
    },
    {
      "id": 151,
      "start": 411.37,
      "end": 417.15,
      "en": "So this is a great way to schedule an appointment, to ask for some time from somebody else.",
      "zh": "所以这是安排约会的好方法，向别人询问一些时间。"
    },
    {
      "id": 152,
      "start": 417.47,
      "end": 420.11,
      "en": "Yeah, and we have some more examples of this phrase.",
      "zh": "是的，我们还有一些这个短语的例子。"
    },
    {
      "id": 153,
      "start": 421.53,
      "end": 422.35,
      "en": "Example one.",
      "zh": "例句一。"
    },
    {
      "id": 154,
      "start": 423.48,
      "end": 426.06,
      "en": "Please book an appointment for next week.",
      "zh": "请预约下周的预约。"
    },
    {
      "id": 155,
      "start": 427.84,
      "end": 428.6,
      "en": "Example two.",
      "zh": "例句二。"
    },
    {
      "id": 156,
      "start": 429.96,
      "end": 432.88,
      "en": "Please schedule an appointment for next week.",
      "zh": "请安排下周的预约。"
    },
    {
      "id": 157,
      "start": 434.24,
      "end": 441.1,
      "en": "Great, so after that, when you're scheduling an appointment, you need to suggest a day when maybe that person has time.",
      "zh": "太好了，所以在那之后，当你安排约会时，你需要建议一个人有时间的时间。"
    },
    {
      "id": 158,
      "start": 441.46,
      "end": 443.9,
      "en": "Yes, let's listen to what they said in the dialogue.",
      "zh": "是的，让我们听听他们在对话中所说的话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 159,
      "start": 450.62,
      "end": 451.42,
      "en": "How's Thursday?",
      "zh": "星期四怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "id": 160,
      "start": 451.84,
      "end": 453.24,
      "en": "Does she have any time available then?",
      "zh": "她那天有空吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 161,
      "start": 454.61,
      "end": 457.31,
      "en": "You say, well, how's Thursday or how's Tuesday?",
      "zh": "你说，好吧，星期四或星期二怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "id": 162,
      "start": 458.24,
      "end": 461.67,
      "en": "And maybe that person doesn't have time that day, so they'll say something like this.",
      "zh": "也许那个人那天没有时间，所以他们会说这样的话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 163,
      "start": 462.24,
      "end": 468.24,
      "en": "Can't you do Tuesday?",
      "zh": "你周二不行吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 164,
      "start": 468.34,
      "end": 474.56,
      "en": "Okay, Erica, so if I want to have a meeting with you, I would say, how's Monday sound or how's Monday?",
      "zh": "好的，埃里卡，所以如果我想和你开会，我会说，星期一的声音怎么样，星期一怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "id": 165,
      "start": 475.96,
      "end": 476.94,
      "en": "Monday's no good.",
      "zh": "星期一不好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 166,
      "start": 477.78,
      "end": 478.7,
      "en": "I'm busy all day.",
      "zh": "我一整天都很忙。"
    },
    {
      "id": 167,
      "start": 479.54,
      "end": 479.92,
      "en": "How's Tuesday?",
      "zh": "星期二怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "id": 168,
      "start": 481.28,
      "end": 482.84,
      "en": "Sorry, Tuesday's no good either.",
      "zh": "抱歉，星期二也不好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 169,
      "start": 483.32,
      "end": 484.22,
      "en": "What about Wednesday?",
      "zh": "星期三呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 170,
      "start": 484.8,
      "end": 486.2,
      "en": "Okay, Wednesday works.",
      "zh": "好的，星期三工作。"
    },
    {
      "id": 171,
      "start": 486.24,
      "end": 487.24,
      "en": "All right, great.",
      "zh": "好，太好了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 172,
      "start": 487.72,
      "end": 488.42,
      "en": "Wednesday's perfect.",
      "zh": "周三完美。"
    },
    {
      "id": 173,
      "start": 488.74,
      "end": 491.04,
      "en": "Okay, great, so we have a meeting on Wednesday.",
      "zh": "好的，太好了，所以我们周三开会。"
    },
    {
      "id": 174,
      "start": 491.5,
      "end": 494.5,
      "en": "Okay, yeah, those are some great phrases, hey, for scheduling an appointment.",
      "zh": "好吧，是的，这些是一些很棒的短语，嘿，用于安排约会。"
    },
    {
      "id": 175,
      "start": 494.76,
      "end": 495.62,
      "en": "Yeah, they're really good.",
      "zh": "是的，他们真的很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 176,
      "start": 496.0,
      "end": 501.92,
      "en": "Okay, so now we can listen to our dialogue a third time and we're ready to understand everything that we've just talked about.",
      "zh": "好的，现在我们可以第三次听我们的对话了，我们已经准备好了解我们刚刚谈到的一切。"
    },
    {
      "id": 177,
      "start": 511.8,
      "end": 513.48,
      "en": "Hello, Fairbrook Consulting.",
      "zh": "您好，费尔布鲁克咨询。"
    },
    {
      "id": 178,
      "start": 514.16,
      "end": 514.8,
      "en": "How may I help you?",
      "zh": "有什么可以帮您？"
    },
    {
      "id": 179,
      "start": 515.24,
      "end": 520.24,
      "en": "Yes, this is Julianne Horton, and I'm calling to arrange an appointment with Ms. McNeely.",
      "zh": "是的，这是 Julianne Horton，我打电话给 McNeely 女士安排约会。"
    },
    {
      "id": 180,
      "start": 520.28,
      "end": 520.8,
      "en": "Certainly.",
      "zh": "当然可以。"
    },
    {
      "id": 181,
      "start": 521.06,
      "end": 522.08,
      "en": "What day were you thinking of?",
      "zh": "您想约哪天？"
    },
    {
      "id": 182,
      "start": 522.44,
      "end": 523.16,
      "en": "How's Thursday?",
      "zh": "星期四怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "id": 183,
      "start": 523.78,
      "end": 525.08,
      "en": "Does she have any time available then?",
      "zh": "她那天有空吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 184,
      "start": 525.48,
      "end": 526.56,
      "en": "Um, let me double check.",
      "zh": "嗯，让我仔细检查一下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 185,
