      "en": "How does next Monday work for you?",
      "zh": "下周一您方便吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 187,
      "start": 531.56,
      "end": 533.42,
      "en": "Actually, I've got something scheduled on Monday.",
      "zh": "其实我周一另有安排。"
    },
    {
      "id": 188,
      "start": 533.98,
      "end": 534.88,
      "en": "Can't you do Tuesday?",
      "zh": "你周二不行吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 189,
      "start": 535.64,
      "end": 536.86,
      "en": "Sure, Tuesday's perfect.",
      "zh": "当然，周二正好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 190,
      "start": 537.88,
      "end": 539.24,
      "en": "May I ask where you're calling from?",
      "zh": "请问您是哪家公司的？"
    },
    {
      "id": 191,
      "start": 539.24,
      "end": 542.24,
      "en": "Sure, Merton Financial Advisors.",
      "zh": "当然，默顿理财顾问公司。"
    },
    {
      "id": 192,
      "start": 542.44,
      "end": 545.08,
      "en": "Oh, actually, Tuesday's no good.",
      "zh": "哦，实际上，星期二不好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 193,
      "start": 545.52,
      "end": 546.04,
      "en": "Sorry about that.",
      "zh": "抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "id": 194,
      "start": 553.24,
      "end": 556.24,
      "en": "The language in this dialogue is really useful, isn't it, Marco?",
      "zh": "这个对话中的语言真的很有用，不是吗，马可？"
    },
    {
      "id": 195,
      "start": 556.35,
      "end": 558.11,
      "en": "Yeah, it's from an everyday situation.",
      "zh": "是的，这是从日常情况来看的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 196,
      "start": 558.65,
      "end": 561.01,
      "en": "You always have to make appointments at some point.",
      "zh": "你总是必须在某个时候预约。"
    },
    {
      "id": 197,
      "start": 561.27,
      "end": 567.15,
      "en": "Yes, and like we said earlier, it's language you can use when you need to talk about work with your boss, maybe.",
      "zh": "是的，就像我们之前说的那样，当你需要和老板谈论工作时，它是你可以使用的语言，也许吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 198,
      "start": 567.24,
      "end": 568.24,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 199,
      "start": 568.24,
      "end": 571.67,
      "en": "Or when you need to do daily things, like go to the doctor.",
      "zh": "或者当你需要每天做的事情时，比如去看医生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 200,
      "start": 572.24,
      "end": 574.24,
      "en": "Or even when you're planning something with your friends.",
      "zh": "甚至当您与朋友计划某事时。"
    },
    {
      "id": 201,
      "start": 574.24,
      "end": 575.24,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 202,
      "start": 575.24,
      "end": 577.24,
      "en": "Yeah, you can use this in all those situations.",
      "zh": "是的，你可以在所有这些情况下使用它。"
    },
    {
      "id": 203,
      "start": 577.24,
      "end": 578.24,
      "en": "In all situations.",
      "zh": "在所有情况下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 204,
      "start": 578.24,
      "end": 579.24,
      "en": "Uh-huh.",
      "zh": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": 205,
      "start": 579.24,
      "end": 582.35,
      "en": "Great. Well, we're out of time now, but I hope you enjoyed our lesson and found it useful.",
      "zh": "太好了。 好吧，我们现在没有时间了，但我希望你喜欢我们的课程并发现它很有用。"
    },
    {
      "id": 206,
      "start": 583.24,
      "end": 589.13,
      "en": "And if you have any questions or comments, please go to our website at EnglishPod.com, where we'll be there to answer everything.",
      "zh": "如果您有任何问题或意见，请访问我们的网站 englishpod.com，我们将在那里回答所有问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": 207,
      "start": 589.43,
      "end": 590.23,
      "en": "Yes, we will.",
      "zh": "是的，我们会的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 208,
      "start": 590.71,
      "end": 591.63,
      "en": "So, thanks for listening, guys.",
      "zh": "所以，谢谢你的收听，伙计们。"
    },
    {
      "id": 209,
      "start": 592.11,
      "end": 593.24,
      "en": "And until next time, goodbye.",
      "zh": "下次再见，拜拜。"
    },
    {
      "id": 210,
      "start": 593.24,
      "end": 599.24,
      "en": "Goodbye.",
      "zh": "再见。"
    }
